WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:44.017
=Episode 9=

01:44.648 --> 01:46.168
You're being overly confident.

01:46.448 --> 01:47.929
Why will Wei Dazhuang succeed?

01:50.209 --> 01:52.448
Because I believe in her.

01:54.769 --> 01:55.728
She's always right.

02:14.209 --> 02:14.808
Let's drink.

02:17.408 --> 02:18.128
I'll have this.

02:25.528 --> 02:26.609
So many stars.

02:28.088 --> 02:28.848
Are you drunk?

02:30.729 --> 02:31.769
No. Look.

02:33.528 --> 02:35.209
What a beautiful starry sky.

02:36.408 --> 02:36.968
Yes.

02:37.968 --> 02:39.209
Autumn night's Milky Way.

02:40.088 --> 02:43.968
This is probably the last,
and the best, time to see it this year.

02:44.968 --> 02:46.289
So beautiful.

02:48.568 --> 02:50.169
Actually, as a woman,

02:51.209 --> 02:53.009
from my perspective and standpoint,

02:54.648 --> 02:56.609
I was deeply touched
by what you said today.

03:01.209 --> 03:02.128
To be honest with you,

03:02.769 --> 03:06.688
I used to think
the 'Sanitary Pad King' label

03:06.968 --> 03:08.769
was just because of your field.

03:09.609 --> 03:11.329
But I believe after today,

03:12.088 --> 03:13.408
you'll give that label

03:14.408 --> 03:18.769
a more profound meaning
and greater value.

03:20.009 --> 03:21.329
Starting to label me now?

03:23.688 --> 03:26.169
But I feel there's more you want to say
beyond just today.

03:28.609 --> 03:29.248
Why's that?

03:29.329 --> 03:32.289
Because... Because your eyes told me so.

04:06.049 --> 04:07.408
It's getting chilly. Put this on.

04:08.449 --> 04:09.449
You're so handsome.

04:19.489 --> 04:20.208
Really.

04:22.208 --> 04:23.808
You really are good-looking.

04:27.768 --> 04:28.609
Look.

04:29.409 --> 04:32.128
Look how nice your eyebrows are.

04:32.409 --> 04:34.049
And your eyes are so bling-bling.

04:34.248 --> 04:35.568
Do you know 'bling-bling'?

04:35.568 --> 04:36.409
Y-You... Take...

04:36.409 --> 04:38.328
How can you be so perfect?

04:38.688 --> 04:40.089
What? Are you shy?

04:40.409 --> 04:41.208
I'm not.

04:41.208 --> 04:42.448
Why are you holding my hands?

04:47.729 --> 04:48.489
Gao Haiming.

04:51.448 --> 04:54.649
Do I really have no charm
in your eyes at all?

05:07.529 --> 05:08.128
Stop this.

05:08.849 --> 05:10.768
I-I'll accuse you of harassment.

05:11.368 --> 05:12.768
Get up. Get up first.

05:14.768 --> 05:15.409
Get up.

05:19.089 --> 05:20.008
You're really asleep?

05:21.289 --> 05:22.609
Wake up.

05:23.128 --> 05:24.169
Don't catch a cold here.

05:25.128 --> 05:25.808
Wake up.

06:01.208 --> 06:01.808
Alright.

06:02.368 --> 06:03.649
Can you open your eyes now?

06:05.929 --> 06:07.169
I had too much.

06:09.729 --> 06:10.808
I know you're not drunk.

06:13.808 --> 06:15.089
So you knew all along.

06:16.128 --> 06:16.969
I'll sleep in my car.

06:17.409 --> 06:18.248
Don't go.

06:19.929 --> 06:22.089
Don't sleep in the car.

06:22.089 --> 06:23.089
Just sleep here.

06:23.089 --> 06:24.248
There's space right here.

06:24.769 --> 06:25.609
That's not necessary.

06:27.049 --> 06:27.929
What scares you?

06:28.489 --> 06:29.649
Listen, if anything happens,

06:29.649 --> 06:30.729
I'll take responsibility.

06:30.929 --> 06:32.049
That's even less necessary.

06:32.169 --> 06:32.808
Not necessary.

06:35.489 --> 06:36.368
Y-You...

06:36.368 --> 06:37.008
Don't go.

06:38.969 --> 06:39.888
I'm scared.

06:52.529 --> 06:53.248
Please.

06:55.529 --> 06:56.448
I'm begging you.

07:26.768 --> 07:27.428
Well...

07:28.488 --> 07:29.969
I-I'm going to wash up.

07:30.409 --> 07:31.448
I will go too.

07:31.929 --> 07:32.768
Then you go ahead.

07:39.008 --> 07:39.808
You go.

07:40.128 --> 07:40.688
Okay.

07:58.128 --> 07:59.808
I'm speechless, really.

08:00.808 --> 08:02.248
Like I'd want to watch you?

08:03.808 --> 08:05.448
You're overthinking it.

08:06.208 --> 08:07.609
As if I wanted to!

08:37.208 --> 08:37.968
What?

08:38.769 --> 08:40.129
Why are you so nervous?

08:40.529 --> 08:42.328
I just wanted to ask if you're cold.

08:44.688 --> 08:45.249
I'm not.

08:46.529 --> 08:47.328
That's good.

08:47.608 --> 08:48.369
Sleep quickly.

08:51.369 --> 08:52.009
Goodnight.

09:45.968 --> 09:46.688
Go back.

09:48.688 --> 09:49.889
I must go back.

09:54.369 --> 09:55.529
Must succeed.

09:56.608 --> 09:57.369
Go back.

09:59.880 --> 10:03.153
♪Heart pounding, won't stop♪

10:03.153 --> 10:07.208
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

10:07.208 --> 10:11.208
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

10:12.009 --> 10:12.889
Stop pretending.

10:13.129 --> 10:14.129
I know you're awake.

10:15.880 --> 10:21.291
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

10:22.504 --> 10:30.120
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

10:30.120 --> 10:38.248
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

10:38.248 --> 10:45.992
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

10:45.992 --> 10:50.905
♪Streaking across the sky♪

10:51.400 --> 11:00.276
♪Just to hold you♪

11:42.529 --> 11:43.488
It's fine.

11:43.488 --> 11:45.169
If it doesn't work once,
we'll try twice.

11:45.169 --> 11:47.049
Even Liu Bei had to knock
more than once, right?

11:47.049 --> 11:48.649
At worst, we'll just do it again.

11:49.649 --> 11:51.409
I think it should work this time.

11:57.169 --> 11:57.769
You're here.

11:57.769 --> 11:58.369
Dr. Wei.

11:59.169 --> 12:01.369
I've sent people
to liaise with the Chuantu Institute.

12:01.649 --> 12:03.328
We'll address your concerns promptly.

12:03.769 --> 12:05.409
We've drawn up an agreement overnight.

12:05.889 --> 12:08.769
It ensures you can focus
on independent R&D for your future work.

12:09.208 --> 12:11.169
You won't need
to deal with any external matters.

12:12.049 --> 12:14.409
For your R&D, the decision-making
is entirely up to you.

12:14.688 --> 12:16.608
If, later on, due to commercial factors,

12:16.608 --> 12:19.088
you become dissatisfied
with our investment or raw materials,

12:19.208 --> 12:21.289
you may terminate the agreement anytime.

12:25.169 --> 12:25.889
No hurry to reply.

12:25.889 --> 12:26.608
Read it first.

12:31.369 --> 12:32.249
I can help you,

12:32.688 --> 12:34.409
but there's one thing
I don't agree with.

12:37.328 --> 12:39.529
Who says a woman
can't be named Wei Dazhuang?

12:40.208 --> 12:41.009
You are...

12:45.049 --> 12:46.088
Let me reintroduce myself.

12:46.608 --> 12:47.328
I am Wei Dazhuang.

12:48.328 --> 12:48.848
Hello.

12:50.568 --> 12:52.009
I really didn't expect this.

12:53.488 --> 12:54.848
After being suspended,

12:55.289 --> 12:56.968
I was planning
to quit my field for good.

12:57.529 --> 12:59.169
To cheer me up, my brother was taking me

12:59.529 --> 13:01.208
on a cross-country motorbike trip.

13:01.649 --> 13:02.409
But you guys,

13:03.529 --> 13:04.328
especially you.

13:04.529 --> 13:05.688
Your sincerity these days

13:05.808 --> 13:07.769
has let me see your dedication
to your own work

13:08.289 --> 13:10.568
and reignited my own courage
for my profession.

13:12.529 --> 13:14.088
The motorbike trip can wait.

13:14.649 --> 13:16.529
I'll join you to do my duty first.

13:17.929 --> 13:19.088
Right. Let me introduce him.

13:19.529 --> 13:20.968
This is my brother, Wei Daqiang.

13:21.369 --> 13:22.289
Together,

13:22.289 --> 13:23.088
we're WE STRONG.

13:24.649 --> 13:26.129
About the two-day impersonation,

13:26.448 --> 13:27.889
I'm sorry. Please take no offense.

13:28.088 --> 13:28.728
Not at all.

13:29.529 --> 13:32.529
Then I entrust my sister to both of you.

13:32.728 --> 13:33.328
Rest assured.

13:34.328 --> 13:35.208
One more thing.

13:35.848 --> 13:38.088
For future work,
I'll liaise with just one person.

13:38.808 --> 13:39.369
That's her.

13:41.328 --> 13:42.529
Alright, I agree.

13:42.808 --> 13:43.249
Good.

13:44.289 --> 13:45.889
Daqiang, I'm off.

13:49.169 --> 13:49.649
Let's go.

13:50.088 --> 13:51.968
Safe travels. See you on Route 318.

13:52.448 --> 13:53.049
Goodbye.

13:58.409 --> 13:59.169
Mr. Gao,

13:59.649 --> 14:00.568
you did really well.

14:00.776 --> 14:01.568
You were good too.

14:04.369 --> 14:04.929
What?

14:49.192 --> 14:50.696
(Letao Tower)

14:51.048 --> 14:52.639
(Strong Absorption, Extra Wide)

14:56.769 --> 14:59.968
First, I think
we can lengthen the wings a bit.

15:00.409 --> 15:02.728
This way, it will adhere well
to various fabrics.

15:03.208 --> 15:06.328
Additionally, besides widening the ends,

15:06.328 --> 15:08.289
the front
could also be slightly widened.

15:09.328 --> 15:11.208
Maybe we can make
the front and back indicators

15:11.208 --> 15:12.369
a bit more distinct.

15:12.608 --> 15:14.249
It helps tell them apart.

15:14.328 --> 15:15.009
Also, I think

15:15.009 --> 15:16.889
we should have a bit of innovation.

15:17.409 --> 15:19.249
Taking cues from the Lovebaby diapers,

15:19.649 --> 15:23.208
we could develop
a type of period panties.

15:23.649 --> 15:24.769
Good. Great idea.

15:25.129 --> 15:26.169
Great. Makes sense.

15:26.369 --> 15:27.568
Regarding the period panties,

15:27.568 --> 15:29.328
comfort must be paramount,

15:29.328 --> 15:30.929
as they're usually worn during sleep.

15:31.088 --> 15:34.208
Also, I think the full range of sizes
must be available.

15:34.409 --> 15:37.289
This can cater to all women
between 150 cm and 180 cm.

15:38.249 --> 15:39.169
Great.

15:39.769 --> 15:42.049
Alright, that's all my suggestions
for today.

15:43.249 --> 15:45.568
Okay, that's all for today then.

15:45.889 --> 15:47.088
Head home soon and rest.

15:47.088 --> 15:47.568
Well done.

15:47.769 --> 15:49.328
- Thank you, boss.
- Thank you, boss.

15:57.369 --> 15:59.568
(Seize the chance to get close.)

16:04.328 --> 16:05.129
Are you free?

16:07.529 --> 16:09.129
(How can I get close to him?)

16:09.129 --> 16:10.568
(Invite him to a theme park?)

16:10.568 --> 16:11.769
(Go shopping? Have dinner?)

16:13.448 --> 16:14.488
Attention!

16:14.488 --> 16:16.328
The system is issuing a random quest.

16:16.608 --> 16:18.649
You must kiss the male lead
within five minutes.

16:18.929 --> 16:20.769
Failure will result if the time expires.

16:20.889 --> 16:21.448
What?

16:22.649 --> 16:23.608
Are you crazy?

16:23.608 --> 16:25.968
Four forty-one, four forty...

16:25.968 --> 16:27.769
Our relationship isn't at that stage.

16:27.769 --> 16:29.529
I can't do something like that,
you know?

16:29.529 --> 16:31.608
Four thirty-three, four thirty-two...

16:31.608 --> 16:32.328
You're ridiculous.

16:32.328 --> 16:33.568
What will happen if I fail?

16:33.608 --> 16:34.728
There will be a punishment.

16:37.769 --> 16:38.328
What's wrong?

16:46.448 --> 16:48.448
Mr. Gao, I suddenly have some new ideas.

16:49.088 --> 16:51.968
Could we discuss them in your office?

16:53.169 --> 16:55.448
Sure, but I need
to go to the Finance Office right now.

16:55.769 --> 16:56.529
Can we talk later?

16:56.529 --> 16:58.848
Three eighteen, three seventeen...

16:58.848 --> 17:00.009
No, I won't make it in time.

17:00.448 --> 17:01.328
For what?

17:01.728 --> 17:02.728
Finance Office.

17:03.929 --> 17:05.248
Is the Finance Office crowded?

17:06.889 --> 17:07.649
I need to go too.

17:07.849 --> 17:08.688
I'll go with you.

17:09.528 --> 17:10.089
Okay.

17:14.369 --> 17:14.968
Mr. Gao.

17:15.208 --> 17:16.048
What now?

17:17.768 --> 17:18.528
I just remembered.

17:18.528 --> 17:19.649
I forgot to grab a document.

17:19.649 --> 17:21.649
Could you come with
me to the archives room?

17:22.288 --> 17:23.288
I'll go first.

17:23.288 --> 17:24.089
Join me later.

17:24.488 --> 17:27.089
One fifty-four, one fifty-three...

17:27.688 --> 17:29.929
Seems like you enjoy cleaning toilets.

17:39.329 --> 17:42.208
Mr. Gao, want some water before going?

17:42.809 --> 17:43.528
I'm not thirsty.

17:44.208 --> 17:45.048
Not thirsty? Then...

17:45.488 --> 17:46.409
I-I'm a bit thirsty.

17:46.409 --> 17:47.329
I need water.

17:53.288 --> 17:53.889
(Seriously?)

17:54.688 --> 17:56.968
(Do you all
have to drink water right now?)

17:58.448 --> 18:02.008
Twenty-five, twenty-four,
twenty-three...

18:03.169 --> 18:04.329
(I can kiss him.)

18:05.728 --> 18:07.448
(But how do I explain after kissing?)

18:08.008 --> 18:09.208
(Will he think I'm crazy?)

18:10.048 --> 18:12.129
(But I really
don't want this punishment.)

18:14.008 --> 18:15.288
(Doomed either way.)

18:16.929 --> 18:17.488
(Let's do it.)

18:20.329 --> 18:21.248
Weren't you thirsty?

18:21.409 --> 18:22.169
Why not drink?

18:25.248 --> 18:25.889
Five.

18:28.609 --> 18:29.329
Four.

18:32.688 --> 18:33.488
Three.

18:36.528 --> 18:37.208
Two.

18:39.768 --> 18:40.488
One.

18:52.072 --> 18:55.176
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

18:58.299 --> 19:01.256
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

19:04.392 --> 19:07.912
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

19:09.832 --> 19:13.768
♪I've become the center of the story♪

19:13.768 --> 19:15.809
Player, congratulations.
Random quest complete.

19:16.008 --> 19:16.649
What's that?

19:17.528 --> 19:18.008
I...

19:19.248 --> 19:21.048
Why did she suddenly kiss him?

19:22.768 --> 19:25.329
Never expected her to be so bold.

19:29.929 --> 19:30.768
Wait, I...

19:35.609 --> 19:36.528
I've lost my mind.

19:37.048 --> 19:38.169
Let me tell you the truth.

19:38.369 --> 19:41.048
Actually, I'm not from your world.

19:41.649 --> 19:44.688
You. All of you.

19:46.569 --> 19:47.288
Including you.

19:48.409 --> 19:52.089
You're all just fictional characters
in a book.

19:52.649 --> 19:53.968
Player attempted spoilers.

19:53.968 --> 19:55.728
Time Rewind mechanism activated.

19:56.129 --> 19:57.208
If triggered five times,

19:57.208 --> 19:58.728
the system will automatically lock.

19:58.728 --> 20:00.528
You'll face unknown punishment.

20:00.649 --> 20:02.488
Three chances remaining.

20:07.809 --> 20:08.728
Weren't you thirsty?

20:09.089 --> 20:09.929
Why not drink?

20:10.528 --> 20:11.768
I'm drinking. Right now.

20:27.809 --> 20:29.008
Are you going to Finance?

20:30.809 --> 20:31.968
I thought about it.

20:32.809 --> 20:34.288
You can probably go alone.

20:34.288 --> 20:35.488
I don't need to go with you.

20:45.809 --> 20:47.569
You actually cheated with this method?

20:48.688 --> 20:49.889
I still have three chances.

20:49.889 --> 20:51.048
I'll save them for later.

20:51.288 --> 20:54.369
Better than cleaning toilets, right?

20:56.369 --> 20:57.048
Lin Huan'er,

20:58.728 --> 20:59.649
are you free later?

20:59.768 --> 21:00.609
Let's go somewhere.

21:01.929 --> 21:02.488
Sure.

21:23.528 --> 21:25.329
So this is where you wanted to bring me?

21:26.968 --> 21:28.809
Never really looked at these, have you?

21:29.929 --> 21:35.288
Most planes here are hand-assembled
from precision mechanical parts.

21:35.728 --> 21:37.849
And most are propeller-driven fighters.

21:38.329 --> 21:40.208
This requires immense time and patience.

21:44.048 --> 21:45.248
I might be boring

21:45.409 --> 21:46.329
to have such a hobby.

21:52.448 --> 21:54.809
I actually think
people who like these things

21:55.448 --> 21:56.809
must have rich inner worlds.

22:01.409 --> 22:02.688
These are zodiac constellations.

22:04.968 --> 22:06.089
Why is one missing here?

22:07.409 --> 22:08.048
Capricorn.

22:09.688 --> 22:11.048
While I don't understand models,

22:11.488 --> 22:13.129
I completely understand that feeling

22:13.248 --> 22:15.488
of wanting
to complete a whole collection.

22:17.369 --> 22:19.369
Missing just this one model

22:20.048 --> 22:21.929
does feel slightly imperfect.

22:24.048 --> 22:25.169
I used to think so too.

22:26.089 --> 22:27.409
But now I believe

22:27.809 --> 22:31.208
imperfection leaves room
for anticipation, doesn't it?

22:33.649 --> 22:34.409
Makes sense.

22:35.288 --> 22:37.416
So you brought me here today to...

22:44.520 --> 22:52.565
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

22:52.565 --> 23:00.392
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

23:01.089 --> 23:02.288
So professional?

23:06.448 --> 23:08.089
Why did you bring me here?

23:12.809 --> 23:14.448
Just wanted to show you.

23:23.728 --> 23:27.929
You said you were going
to the Finance Office today. Then...

23:28.688 --> 23:31.329
Then I realized it wasn't essential,
so I didn't go.

23:33.849 --> 23:34.488
What's wrong?

23:41.809 --> 23:42.488
Nothing.

23:43.008 --> 23:44.889
I feel like I've forgotten something.

23:45.448 --> 23:46.208
It's good.

23:49.008 --> 23:50.089
Let it be forgotten.

23:50.409 --> 23:51.329
Don't push yourself.

23:58.968 --> 24:00.768
Is this a fighter model
you just finished?

24:02.169 --> 24:03.409
Yes. It's not painted yet.

24:04.409 --> 24:06.409
No wonder
it looks so drab and colorless.

24:07.409 --> 24:08.169
Care to try?

24:09.929 --> 24:10.849
To paint it?

24:11.889 --> 24:13.008
Forget it.

24:14.089 --> 24:16.849
I'm afraid I might damage it.

24:17.528 --> 24:19.409
Even if damaged, it would be unique.

24:21.889 --> 24:24.409
Then can I paint it however I want?

24:24.609 --> 24:25.409
Of course.

24:26.688 --> 24:27.129
Alright.

24:33.704 --> 24:36.808
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

24:39.931 --> 24:42.888
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

24:46.024 --> 24:49.544
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

24:51.464 --> 24:56.520
♪I've become the center of the story♪

24:57.416 --> 25:01.786
♪I must escape this dream♪

25:03.368 --> 25:07.968
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

25:08.936 --> 25:12.840
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

25:13.160 --> 25:15.336
♪A fake world♪

25:16.040 --> 25:21.032
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

25:22.952 --> 25:26.056
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

25:29.179 --> 25:32.136
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

25:35.272 --> 25:38.792
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

25:40.712 --> 25:45.768
♪I've become the center of the story♪

25:46.664 --> 25:51.720
♪I must escape this dream♪

25:55.288 --> 25:55.968
Almost done.

25:58.184 --> 26:02.088
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

26:02.169 --> 26:02.968
Truly one of a kind.

26:05.688 --> 26:07.369
Why paint it this color?

26:09.048 --> 26:13.089
Because I don't know
what color a fighter should be.

26:13.889 --> 26:15.089
But in my mind,

26:15.448 --> 26:18.569
the millennium should be this colorful

26:18.809 --> 26:19.688
and vibrant.

26:24.008 --> 26:25.409
Do you believe in parallel worlds?

26:26.528 --> 26:27.089
Yes, I do.

26:30.889 --> 26:34.048
Perhaps in a parallel world,
another version of me

26:34.929 --> 26:37.288
has no memory of the millennium at all.

26:38.649 --> 26:40.409
So I don't want to have any regrets.

26:41.528 --> 26:42.329
I hope

26:43.169 --> 26:46.569
to leave something behind
before the millennium arrives.

26:52.328 --> 26:55.311
♪Entwined worries linger♪

26:57.768 --> 26:58.268
You...

26:59.889 --> 27:02.369
I-Is this a bit of paint
on your face here?

27:02.369 --> 27:03.169
Or is it varnish?

27:05.528 --> 27:07.448
I don't see any. Where?

27:07.809 --> 27:08.329
Here.

27:08.902 --> 27:11.962
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

27:13.128 --> 27:16.580
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

27:17.576 --> 27:23.102
♪Until the world's end♪

27:25.512 --> 27:29.308
♪If I could♪

27:29.896 --> 27:32.712
♪Keep loving you♪

27:33.736 --> 27:36.136
♪Hearing two hearts♪

27:36.136 --> 27:41.052
♪Beating together♪

27:42.024 --> 27:45.888
♪If I could♪

27:45.888 --> 27:49.128
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

27:50.184 --> 27:57.509
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

28:06.728 --> 28:07.208
Hello?

28:12.809 --> 28:13.688
Congratulations.

28:13.849 --> 28:16.688
The male lead's fondness toward you
has reached 59%.

28:17.889 --> 28:18.528
I'm busy.

28:18.768 --> 28:20.288
If there's nothing urgent...

28:22.889 --> 28:23.409
Alright.

28:24.528 --> 28:25.248
Come over now.

28:25.728 --> 28:26.809
I'll be at the model shop.

28:30.688 --> 28:32.169
Are you meeting someone here?

28:32.929 --> 28:33.929
I'll head off then.

28:34.288 --> 28:35.528
See you at the office tomorrow.

28:36.296 --> 28:36.929
Bye-bye.

28:49.889 --> 28:52.688
You seem especially radiant today.

28:53.208 --> 28:53.809
Do I?

28:55.169 --> 28:56.048
I have a feeling

28:57.048 --> 28:58.768
that my goal is about to be achieved.

28:59.048 --> 29:00.048
What goal?

29:01.169 --> 29:01.889
Secret.

29:04.569 --> 29:05.889
I know anyway.

29:06.169 --> 29:08.609
Isn't it just about
getting a Ph.D. for Letao?

29:09.288 --> 29:11.288
So Letao's problem
is basically solved now, right?

29:11.768 --> 29:13.688
You're quite well-informed.

29:13.809 --> 29:15.609
Of course. Who do you think I am?

29:16.169 --> 29:18.329
I heard it's a female Ph.D.

29:18.528 --> 29:19.048
That's right.

29:19.528 --> 29:20.569
Her name is Dazhuang.

29:20.569 --> 29:21.208
Interesting?

29:23.089 --> 29:25.208
That name sounds quite masculine.

29:25.889 --> 29:30.248
She's a cool girl
with a straightforward personality.

29:30.409 --> 29:32.048
And she's a real expert in her field.

29:32.688 --> 29:33.889
Here for only a few days,

29:34.048 --> 29:36.609
she's already solved
many of Letao's technical challenges.

29:37.048 --> 29:37.849
She's that good?

29:38.968 --> 29:41.609
Then why didn't she
keep working at the institute?

29:43.929 --> 29:45.569
It's quite unfair.

29:46.288 --> 29:48.768
She was supposed
to be promoted to team leader,

29:48.968 --> 29:50.369
leading a team on projects.

29:50.688 --> 29:52.288
But just because she's female,

29:52.968 --> 29:54.809
a parachuted candidate
took the position.

29:54.968 --> 29:58.409
Later, they had disagreements
on research approaches,

29:58.649 --> 30:00.809
and she was forced
into an internal transfer.

30:01.169 --> 30:02.809
I understand that feeling all too well.

30:02.809 --> 30:05.329
I used to post my serial mystery comic
on a forum.

30:05.448 --> 30:07.288
When they saw my profile picture
was a girl,

30:07.288 --> 30:08.688
the comments started flooding in.

30:08.889 --> 30:09.929
Isn't that infuriating?

30:10.968 --> 30:12.448
Mengmeng, just ignore them.

30:12.688 --> 30:14.048
All your dreams will come true.

30:14.288 --> 30:14.809
Really.

30:17.409 --> 30:19.208
Every time you say things like that,

30:19.409 --> 30:22.369
you sound just like a prophet.

30:23.288 --> 30:24.409
What do you mean, 'like'?

30:24.409 --> 30:25.728
I am the prophet.

30:30.528 --> 30:31.968
Then what's your dream?

30:36.288 --> 30:37.409
My dream...

30:38.649 --> 30:40.369
(I should be going back soon, right?)

30:41.528 --> 30:42.129
Mengmeng,

30:43.688 --> 30:45.248
if one day I'm gone,

30:45.809 --> 30:46.849
will you miss me?

30:47.809 --> 30:48.688
Where are you going?

30:49.169 --> 30:51.089
Do you want to go abroad with Xiaojue?

30:53.688 --> 30:54.809
You can say that.

30:57.968 --> 30:59.728
Then I'll wish you well.

31:01.288 --> 31:02.849
Because no matter where you go,

31:02.968 --> 31:04.569
we'll still be best friends.

31:05.089 --> 31:06.688
Our hearts won't be apart.

31:09.488 --> 31:10.329
You're right.

31:11.688 --> 31:12.768
Wishing well is enough.

31:14.169 --> 31:15.968
I'll wish you and Hu Tiehan well too.

31:27.248 --> 31:28.129
(What's going on?)

31:28.849 --> 31:29.488
(It's broken?)

31:31.448 --> 31:33.169
They were college classmates.

31:33.329 --> 31:35.169
They started dating during college.

31:35.688 --> 31:36.609
After graduation,

31:36.728 --> 31:38.208
Ou Xiaojue went to study in the UK.

31:38.649 --> 31:41.992
Lin Huan'er worked several jobs
to support him by covering

31:41.992 --> 31:43.248
his tuition and living costs.

31:43.809 --> 31:45.809
Later, Lin Huan'er joined Yunsheng

31:45.968 --> 31:47.248
and secured the Letao account.

31:47.409 --> 31:48.569
Then her life improved.

32:10.248 --> 32:11.569
Miss Lin, do you need something?

32:11.889 --> 32:13.569
I need to talk about work with Mr. Gao.

32:13.569 --> 32:14.409
Mr. Gao is busy.

32:14.409 --> 32:15.569
You can talk to me.

32:16.288 --> 32:16.968
Let her in.

32:28.169 --> 32:29.929
Mr. Gao, I'm here

32:29.929 --> 32:33.528
to align on the women's product
marketing plan

32:33.688 --> 32:35.528
to ensure smooth follow-up.

32:36.688 --> 32:39.768
You went to great lengths
to help me recruit Dr. Wei.

32:40.048 --> 32:41.129
You supported the R&D team

32:41.129 --> 32:42.089
in adjusting the design.

32:42.809 --> 32:44.048
You've made the marketing plan.

32:44.288 --> 32:45.048
I'm grateful.

32:45.688 --> 32:46.889
But I'm curious.

32:47.849 --> 32:49.169
You're working so hard.

32:49.688 --> 32:51.248
Is there some special reason behind it?

32:55.968 --> 32:56.688
For the money?

32:58.208 --> 33:00.329
(His mood shift is so abrupt.)

33:01.089 --> 33:02.248
(Is there a bug?)

33:02.849 --> 33:04.528
(Did I say something misleading?)

33:05.968 --> 33:08.169
W-Well, not entirely for the money.

33:09.208 --> 33:11.528
I also want
to see Letao succeed and grow.

33:12.488 --> 33:14.369
After all, we're friends, aren't we?

33:16.369 --> 33:17.008
Friends?

33:17.688 --> 33:19.528
(Does he want more than friends?)

33:19.728 --> 33:20.968
(Is he seeking a clear status?)

33:25.849 --> 33:26.329
Well,

33:26.728 --> 33:28.728
whether it's work or personal life,

33:28.889 --> 33:30.248
I'd love to take things further.

33:32.889 --> 33:35.208
I just feel some concepts

33:35.208 --> 33:37.089
don't need to be followed so rigidly.

33:37.688 --> 33:39.409
Personal thoughts
could be more open-minded.

33:39.409 --> 33:41.008
That better fosters a relationship.

33:41.728 --> 33:42.248
No need.

33:43.688 --> 33:44.569
I'll read the plan.

33:45.048 --> 33:46.169
If there's nothing else,

33:46.288 --> 33:46.849
please leave.

33:50.409 --> 33:50.849
Okay.

33:53.768 --> 33:54.288
Wait.

33:58.169 --> 33:59.008
Any plans tonight?

34:00.728 --> 34:01.208
No.

34:02.048 --> 34:03.768
I have no plans after work.

34:04.008 --> 34:04.528
I'm free.

34:05.849 --> 34:06.889
What I mean is,

34:07.288 --> 34:08.448
for your next visit,

34:08.929 --> 34:09.689
dress the part.

34:10.168 --> 34:10.984
For your own image.

34:31.929 --> 34:32.448
Mr. Gao,

34:33.168 --> 34:35.968
should we let Miss Lin coordinate
with the marketing department?

34:36.409 --> 34:39.048
It's inappropriate for her
to keep coming directly to you.

34:40.088 --> 34:41.209
Why is it inappropriate?

34:42.209 --> 34:43.088
We're just friends.

34:45.088 --> 34:45.568
Understood.

35:00.008 --> 35:01.608
(Where exactly did it go wrong?)

35:02.088 --> 35:04.128
(His attitude
is so different from yesterday.)

35:08.608 --> 35:09.168
Huan'er,

35:09.369 --> 35:10.488
you look so nice today.

35:10.729 --> 35:11.488
Got a date tonight?

35:13.289 --> 35:13.968
I thought I did.

35:15.209 --> 35:15.889
Lingling.

35:16.849 --> 35:20.769
Do you think what I'm wearing today
isn't suitable for work?

35:22.128 --> 35:23.769
It's perfectly suitable.

35:24.329 --> 35:25.209
Right?

35:25.329 --> 35:26.488
It's formal.

35:26.689 --> 35:28.168
I meant to ask earlier, Huan'er,

35:28.329 --> 35:29.608
where did you buy this outfit?

35:29.608 --> 35:30.488
It looks amazing.

35:30.729 --> 35:32.528
I'd like to wear this for my next date.

35:32.929 --> 35:33.528
Right?

35:33.528 --> 35:36.369
This outfit works
for both the office and a date.

35:36.488 --> 35:37.329
Right?

35:37.329 --> 35:38.088
Absolutely.

35:39.128 --> 35:40.088
Then why?

35:40.929 --> 35:43.889
He told me to dress the part.

35:44.809 --> 35:46.168
Am I not dressed the part enough?

35:46.289 --> 35:48.929
Are things not going well with that guy?

35:49.249 --> 35:49.929
Tell us about it.

35:50.048 --> 35:51.249
We can help you figure it out.

35:51.849 --> 35:52.329
Alright.

35:52.849 --> 35:54.568
For two strangers,

35:54.568 --> 35:56.929
if they want to develop
a romantic relationship,

35:57.128 --> 35:59.209
shouldn't they start as friends?

35:59.648 --> 36:00.689
That's normal, isn't it?

36:01.168 --> 36:02.729
That approach is fine.

36:04.448 --> 36:06.968
So I suggested we be friends.

36:07.809 --> 36:08.689
He didn't agree.

36:09.889 --> 36:11.889
Then I said
we could take it a step further.

36:12.889 --> 36:13.929
And he got mad.

36:14.369 --> 36:15.008
He got mad?

36:21.008 --> 36:21.608
Don't say it.

36:22.289 --> 36:22.809
How silly.

36:23.048 --> 36:23.608
Meaning?

36:23.608 --> 36:24.488
Let's work.

36:24.889 --> 36:25.689
Dating challenged.

36:25.968 --> 36:26.889
You've gained weight.

36:30.729 --> 36:34.769
(So he wants
to be good friends with me?)

36:38.673 --> 36:41.656
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:42.865 --> 36:45.636
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:47.537 --> 36:53.450
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:55.247 --> 36:58.307
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

36:59.473 --> 37:02.925
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

37:03.921 --> 37:09.447
♪Until the world's end♪

37:11.857 --> 37:15.653
♪If I could♪

37:16.241 --> 37:19.057
♪Keep loving you♪

37:20.081 --> 37:22.481
♪Hearing two hearts♪

37:22.481 --> 37:27.397
♪Beating together♪

37:28.369 --> 37:32.233
♪If I could♪

37:32.233 --> 37:35.473
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:36.529 --> 37:43.854
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

37:44.913 --> 37:47.857
♪Entwined worries linger♪

37:49.105 --> 37:51.857
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

37:53.713 --> 37:59.493
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

38:01.425 --> 38:04.450
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

38:05.695 --> 38:09.361
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

38:10.129 --> 38:15.976
♪Until the world's end♪

38:17.969 --> 38:21.873
♪If I could♪

38:22.481 --> 38:25.233
♪Keep loving you♪

38:26.289 --> 38:28.625
♪Hearing two hearts♪

38:28.625 --> 38:33.585
♪Beating together♪

38:34.577 --> 38:38.140
♪If I could♪

38:38.140 --> 38:41.841
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

